Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:19.29,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}inochi no kirameki (Destiny will begin tonight)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.33,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:57.45,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:01:01.87,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:08.13,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je tirerai un fil de lumière
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:18.06,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Chaque fois que je surmonte la douleur
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:27.78,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Mon cœur devient plus affûté (N’abandonne jamais)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:36.12,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Au bout de ce destin sans fin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:39.91,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je fais le serment devant cette océan lumineux
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:42.58,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Que je tiendrai bon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:44.71,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si je tombe ici
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:50.30,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je lèguerai le sens de la vie
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:53.05,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le ciel s’effondre
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:55.35,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si le firmament me tombe dessus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:02:00.02,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je briserai les desseins d’un dieu fou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.02,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:04.15,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:08.61,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:13.11,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}J’allume une flamme
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:19.29,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}L’étincelle de la vie (Le destin commencera ce soir)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:57.09,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je fais face
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:22:02.34,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Ma tête est remplie d'espoir
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:11.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}D'un quelconque endroit autre qu'ici
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:17.27,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je souris
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:22.61,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Intérieurement et pendant tout ce temps
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:30.91,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je m'interroge sur mon destin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:37.50,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je pense à
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:42.42,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Toutes les choses
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:47.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Que j'aimerais faire
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:51.64,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dans ma vie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:56.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je suis un rêveur
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:23:01.65,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Un lointain songeur
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.65,0:23:07.16,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Rêvant d'espoir
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.16,0:23:11.29,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dès à présent
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:57.09,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:22:02.34,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:11.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:17.27,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I smile
