Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:30.91,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:37.50,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:42.42,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All the things
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:47.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'd like to do
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:51.64,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}In my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:56.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:23:01.65,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A distant dreamer
